::  modules/comlink/vantage/glow/fold-studio-deck.glow -- Vantage Deck!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-studio-deck-cap
  |=  [surface=@ud bytes=@ud desks=@ud]                 ::  1..4, <=256K, 50
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified desks
  ~|  'vantage-studio-deck-surface-or-50-desk-breach'   ::  50/50 Glow desks
  ?>  &(gte(surface 1) lte(surface 4) lte(bytes 262144) gte(desks 50))
  desks
--
